English:
inductive InjectiveFunction
  parameters: (α : Type u)
  constructors (1):
    - mapToSelf: (xs : List (Σ _ : α, α)) : xs.map Sigma.fst ~ xs.map Sigma.snd -> List.Nodup (xs.map Sigma.snd) -> InjectiveFunction α

中文:
归纳类型 InjectiveFunction
  参数: (α : 类型u)
